# Architecture anti-debt

- New `Generation.kind` → workflow + builder + parity test + `jobs/registry.py` + `PIPELINES` + `stages.ts`. Never copy `create_*` or add kind if/elif.
- New post-process UI → extend `PostProcessDialogShell` / `useAssetJobForm` only.
- Generate stage variants share one `GENERATE_STAGES` array; do not duplicate the list.
- No scratch in repo: `_patch_*`, one-off audits under `docs/`, temp scripts beside `app/`.
- Touching `TimelineStrip` / `Viewer` / `store/timeline` → extract the touched piece first; do not grow the monolith.
- Layers: `api/client` must not import zustand; API DTOs must not import store; keep routers thin (logic in `services` / `jobs`).
- Shared helpers once: peaks, `missing_file`, graph `_link`, recipe `_resolve`, `persist_generation`.
